    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people want to help, but i don't even want to be helped. i just want to be still. everything is so loud and so painful... it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just let go completely. don't you think there's a certain beauty in just letting the darkness be the end of it?",
